{
  "kind": "AutoTemplate",
  "apiVersion": "v1",
  "metadata": {
    "id": "lead-generation-agent",
    "name": "Lead generation agent",
    "description": "\n\n## **Who this is for**\n\nThis workflow is for **digital marketing agencies** or **sales teams** who want to **automatically find business leads** based on industry & location, gather their contact details, and send **personalized cold emails** — all from one form submission.\n\n---\n\n## **What this workflow does**\n\nThis workflow starts every time someone submits the **Lead Machine Form**. It then:\n\n* **Scrapes business data** (company name, website, phone, address, category) using **Apify** based on business type & location.\n* **Extracts the best email address** from each business website using **Google Gemini AI**.\n* **Stores valid leads** in **Google Sheets**.\n* **Generates cold email content** (subject + body) with AI based on your preferred tone (Friendly, Professional, Simple).\n* **Sends the cold email** via Gmail.\n* **Updates the sheet** with send status & timestamp.\n\n---\n\n## **Setup**\n\nTo set this workflow up:\n\n1. **Form Trigger** – Customize the “Lead Machine” form fields if needed (Business Type, Location, Lead Number, Email Style).\n2. **Apify API** – Add your Apify Actor Endpoint URL in the HTTP Request node.\n3. **Google Gemini** – Add credentials for extracting email addresses.\n4. **Google Sheets** – Connect your sheet for storing leads & email status.\n5. **OpenAI** – Add your credentials for cold email generation.\n6. **Gmail** – Connect your Gmail account for sending cold emails.\n\n---\n\n## **How to customize this workflow to your needs**\n\n* Change the **AI email prompt** to reflect your brand’s voice and offer.\n* Add **filters** to only target leads that meet specific criteria (e.g., website must exist, email must be verified).\n* Modify the **Google Sheets structure** to track extra info like “Follow-up Date” or “Lead Source”.\n* Switch Gmail to another email provider if preferred.\n\n---",
    "category": [
      "automation"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "Lead Generation",
      "Multimodal AI",
      "n8n-converted"
    ],
    "author": "Converted from the public n8n template catalog",
    "source": "community",
    "featuredConnectors": [
      "/managedApis/gmail",
      "/managedApis/googlesheet",
      "connectionProviders/Http",
      "connectionProviders/request",
      "connectionProviders/schedule"
    ]
  },
  "workflow": {
    "definition": {
      "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
      "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
      "triggers": {
        "Manual_Trigger": {
          "type": "Request",
          "kind": "Http"
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "On_form_submission": {
          "type": "Compose",
          "inputs": {
            "conversionStatus": "unsupported",
            "n8nNodeName": "On form submission",
            "n8nNodeType": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
            "message": "Replace this placeholder with an equivalent LAA action."
          },
          "description": "Generated placeholder for an unsupported n8n node.",
          "metadata": {
            "x-n8n-original-parameters": {
              "options": {
                "buttonLabel": "GO 🚀",
                "appendAttribution": false
              },
              "formTitle": "Lead Machine",
              "formFields": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "fieldLabel": "Business Type",
                    "placeholder": "e.g. Plumber",
                    "requiredField": true
                  },
                  {
                    "fieldLabel": "Location",
                    "placeholder": "e.g. Rome, Italy",
                    "requiredField": true
                  },
                  {
                    "fieldType": "number",
                    "fieldLabel": "Lead Number",
                    "requiredField": true
                  },
                  {
                    "fieldType": "dropdown",
                    "fieldLabel": "Email Style",
                    "fieldOptions": {
                      "values": [
                        {
                          "option": "Friendly"
                        },
                        {
                          "option": "Professional"
                        },
                        {
                          "option": "Simple"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "formDescription": "Provide the Info Below"
            }
          },
          "runAfter": {}
        },
        "HTTP_Request": {
          "type": "Http",
          "inputs": {
            "method": "GET",
            "uri": "=Apify_Actor_Endpoint_URL",
            "body": "{\n    \"includeWebResults\": false,\n    \"language\": \"en\",\n    \"locationQuery\": \"@{body('On_form_submission')?['Location']}\",\n    \"maxCrawledPlacesPerSearch\": @{body('On_form_submission')?['Lead Number']},\n    \"maxImages\": 0,\n    \"maximumLeadsEnrichmentRecords\": 0,\n    \"scrapeContacts\": false,\n    \"scrapeDirectories\": false,\n    \"scrapeImageAuthors\": false,\n    \"scrapePlaceDetailPage\": false,\n    \"scrapeReviewsPersonalData\": true,\n    \"scrapeTableReservationProvider\": false,\n    \"searchStringsArray\": [\n        \"@{body('On_form_submission')?['Business Type']}\"\n    ],\n    \"skipClosedPlaces\": false\n}"
          },
          "runAfter": {
